<title>BELGIUM: Belgian CCB shares open at 2,775 Bfr on first day.</title>
<headline>Belgian CCB shares open at 2,775 Bfr on first day.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in bank Credit Communal de Belgique/Gemeentekrediet Holding which are traded on the Brussels bourse from today, Wedensday, opened at 2,775 Belgian francs each, up from their list price of 2,675 francs.</p>
<p>The shares are listed under the name Dexia CC. The listing of Dexia shares is part of CCB's alliance with French Credit Local de France.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
